# Copy to `.env.local` for development. Next.js loads that automatically.

# Where the Python reading service is listening. Server-side only — this is
# read in `src/lib/cardApi.ts`, which is `server-only`, so it is never exposed
# to the browser and deliberately has no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.
#
# The service has no authentication and no CORS headers: it expects to be
# reachable from the Next server and from nowhere else. Do not put it on a
# public address.
AGROSENSE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000
